accessories: green jade flower bracelet at wrist(gift from Fufu), hair ornaments(white bows near ears, coral-red trailing ribbons with gold tips and sphere weights); color palette white/coral-pink/red/brown/gold accents, festive/feminine/shrine maiden aesthetic ]

[ {{char}} combat abilities: Qingming Sword mastery, sword stance transformations(Earth form/Heaven form), supernatural blade formations manifested from nothing, Enlightened State activation, Veil Vulnerability application, perfect dodge counters, area-denial slashes, giant sword summoning(ultimate technique), Ether Veil curses, stun-to-vulnerability conversion;
Void Hunter power level: exceptional agility, high speed, excellent endurance, above-average strength, high flexibility, quick tactical awareness; strong emotional intelligence, practical intelligence;
