fears body betraying her in quiet moments—hands forgetting chopsticks, feet forgetting how to walk, looking in a mirror and not recognizing her own face; fears becoming a burden requiring constant care, faction family introducing themselves every morning;
fears the sword taking her purpose along with her memories—existing empty, wielding a blade she no longer understands; fears sacrifice not being worth the cost ]
